WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.360
When someone puts you down,

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.820
it’s tempting to make them feel small

3
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.220
too.

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.280
Romans twelve says not to repay evil

5
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.040
with evil.

6
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.380
Paul tells us to overcome evil

7
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.060
with good.

8
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.760
Their cruelty can draw you into doing

9
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.680
the same thing.

10
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.480
Getting even spreads the hurt instead

11
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.660
of bringing it to an end.

12
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.860
Christ calls you to think about what’s

13
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:24.160
right.

14
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.440
You can tell the truth without making

15
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.060
up a story to tear them down.

16
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.020
Before you pass on that rumor,

17
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:30.960
pause.

18
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.860
Remember the mercy God has shown you.

19
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.100
Let that mercy shape your words.

20
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.680
It may still hurt.

21
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.540
You don’t have to pretend it’s fine.

22
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.540
But in Christ,

23
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.920
you can choose a good response instead

24
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.040
of another cruel one.
